I don't recognize "talentuous" as a valid English word, and based on its 
roots, would not associate it with mere ability.  The use of "talent" in 
the current gismu definition is out in the related information area, and 
makes sense only if one immediately contrasts it with stati which is the 
normal word used to refer to talent.

